        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Samuele wakaambila Saulo wati, Wacita cabufubafuba. Teewatobela mulao wa-Jehova Leza wako ngwaakakulailila. Nkaambo Jehova naakiimya bwami bwako bwaku-Israyeli lyoonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
