        },
        {
          "text": "Pele sunu bwami bwako tabukonzyi kwiimikwa pe. Jehova walisalila kale muntu mbuli moyo wakwe, nkabela Jehova wamwaamba kuti abe mweendelezi wabantu bakwe, nkaambo kakuti uwe teewacita mbuli mbwaakalailila Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
