        },
        {
          "text": "Lino teekwakajanwa mufuzi naba omwe mucisi coonse caba-Israyeli, nkaambo ba-Filisti bakaamba bati, Ba-Hebrayo inga balacita mapanga na masumu. ",
          "type": "text",
