        },
        {
          "text": "Pele ba-Israyeli boonse bakali kuseluka kuya kuba-Filisti umwi umwi kuyookwengya mulomo wapulau lyakwe ajamba lyakwe akaa-nkuni kakwe apanga lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
